{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57568","headline":"北方歌 · 无名氏","name":"北方歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北方玄武身本黑，家乡体住崑仑国。\n寻常定志有长生，方圆任性可生得。\n随流信运长爲客，谁识我身性无白。\n不独含着五行精，就中偏感阴阳魄。\n调和兑震爲夫妇，四象排来在高处。\n分明指似後人言，莫使昏迷错天路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}